 {"id":"aab08c89-386d-4160-86e5-75c1642d5eba","name":"Baseus 2-in-1 Matrix HDMI Switcher Nexiobd","slug":"baseus-2-in-1-matrix-hdmi-switcher-nexiobd","brand":"Baseus","description":"<h2><strong>Baseus 2-in-1 Matrix HDMI Switcher Nexiobd Specifications</strong></h2><ul><li><p>Brand: Baseus</p></li><li><p>Type: HDMI Switch &amp; Splitter (2-in-1)</p></li><li><p>Input Ports: 2 HDMI Inputs</p></li><li><p>Output Ports: 1 HDMI Output / 2 Outputs (Switch Mode)</p></li><li><p>Resolution Support: Up to 4K @ 30Hz</p></li><li><p>Transmission: Audio &amp; Video Sync</p></li><li><p>Power Requirement: No External Power Needed</p></li><li><p>Switching Method: Manual Button Switch</p></li><li><p>Indicator: LED Digital Light Display</p></li><li><p>Compatibility: Universal HDMI Devices</p></li><li><p>Build: Compact, Portable Design</p></li></ul><p></p><h2><strong>Baseus 2-in-1 Matrix HDMI Switcher Nexiobd Features:</strong></h2><ul><li><p>The <strong>Baseus 2-in-1 Matrix HDMI Switcher</strong> is a compact yet powerful solution for managing multiple HDMI devices with ease. If you are tired of constantly plugging and unplugging cables, this smart device offers a simple and efficient way to switch between devices. Moreover, it is perfect for users who have limited HDMI ports on their TV, monitor, or projector.</p></li><li><p>This HDMI switcher supports a two-way switching function. That means you can connect two HDMI sources (like a gaming console and set-top box) to one display. On the other hand, you can also connect one source to two displays (one at a time). Therefore, it provides great flexibility for both home entertainment and office setups.</p></li><li><p>In addition, the device supports <strong>4K resolution at 30Hz</strong>, ensuring clear and sharp visuals. Whether you are watching movies or playing games, you will enjoy high-definition output without any lag. Furthermore, it offers synchronous audio and video transmission, so the sound quality remains perfectly aligned with